# Sources the binaries embed (include_str!/include_bytes!: the examples in
# crates/client, the fonts and libraries in crates/assets) are checked out
# exactly as committed, so a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf builds the
# same bytes as every other platform. Without this the Windows app showed
# its examples with a CR at the end of every line.
web/examples/** -text
assets/** -text
